H2 with two k points, HSE orbitals, nspin=1, and an RPA response kernel.
Both LCAO bands are included. The default optical velocity includes
the ground-state Fock commutator, checked at all 100 spectrum points.

The 08_RI_lr_absorption_csr and 08_RI_lr_absorption_csr_spin2 tests
run this fixture with one and two spin channels. They export density,
orbitals and text H(R)/S(R) in scratch directories, compare the in-memory
and standalone spectra, check the closed-shell spectrum against the
same reference, and evaluate direct velocity on the standalone inputs.
The two-spin test checks the read of both CSR spin blocks.
